<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Croesus says approves new gold plant.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Croesus says approves new gold plant.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croesus Mining NL said on Wednesday it has approved construction of a one million tonne a year treatment plant at its Binduli gold mine in Western Australia for a cost of A$20.8 million.</p>
<p>The expansion is the first stage of the company's plans to increase gold output to 65,000 ounces a year from 40,000 ounces currently, Croesus said.</p>
</text>
